  "problems": "RE/DONE publishes no general women's body-measurement chart on its own site (shopredone.com/pages/size-guide is 404; no size page in the sitemap). Each product has its own per-style garment-measurement image, so only two representative styles were recorded; other styles (Comfort Stretch, 70s Bootcut, RE/DONE x Levi's reconstructed vintage) have their own charts and will differ. Values read visually from 828x205 PNG images (https://shopredone.com/cdn/shop/files/188-3WSTV27.png, https://shopredone.com/cdn/shop/files/141-03W90HRLO_SIZEGUIDE.png); fractions converted to decimals (e.g. 25 1/2 -> 25.5), which is notation only, not rounding. Rise and leg opening per size also published but have no schema field. Stove Pipe fabric is rigid 100% cotton. A retailer conversion table (Smallable: 24/25=FR 34, US 0-2, etc.) exists but was not used because the brand site has charts."
